          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does beauty sleep works?",
            "answer": "<p>Beauty Sleep is your body’s natural overnight recovery process. While you rest, your body supports essential repair and renewal. </p><p>YUNA complements this process with 8 premium ingredients that support restful sleep, relaxation, antioxidant protection and gut health — helping you wake up feeling refreshed, restored and radiant.</p>",
