          "settings": {
            "question": "Does Yuna have side effects?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>No. We use natural herbs formula.</strong><br/><br/>That's what sets us apart from sleep supplements that just sedate you into sleep with high-dose melatonin or antihistamines, prescription sleep aids.</p><p>Yuna works differently. It focuses on overnight skin and body renewal support while you sleep. </p><p>As a result, our customers shared they wake up feeling refreshed in the mornings.</p>",
